  },
  {
    num: 'Gate 3',
    title: 'Proof of value',
    body: 'Show your case study to someone actually working as a UX or product designer, not a friend or family member, and ask directly: "Would this get me shortlisted over the hundred other junior applicants for this role?" Use their answer, not your own hope, to decide.',
