  <h2 id="skills">Skills that actually move the pay needle</h2>

  <p>
    Whatever course or specific track you land in, the skills below are what actually separate the Rs 3-5 LPA
    outcome from the Rs 10-18 LPA+ outcome inside the same broad field.
  </p>

  <div class="table-wrap">
